{"title":"Math Jam","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>A <b>Math Jam</b> is a free online class or information session hosted by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\">Art of Problem Solving</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Schoolhouse\" title=\"AoPS Schoolhouse\">classroom</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Topics\">Topics</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_Jam&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Topics\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/school\">AoPS Online School</a> and classes.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AMC\">AMC</a> -- AoPS hosts sessions for discussion of the problems from each year's <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10\" title=\"AMC 10\">AMC 10</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12\" title=\"AMC 12\">AMC 12</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AIME\">AIME</a> exams.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MATHCOUNTS\" title=\"MATHCOUNTS\">MATHCOUNTS</a> -- <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathew_Crawford\" title=\"Mathew Crawford\">Mathew Crawford</a> and others host numerous problem discussion and game-like Math Jams for MathCounts students.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MOEMS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MOEMS\">MOEMS</a> -- <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Richard_Kalman\" title=\"Richard Kalman\">Richard Kalman</a> and several MOEMS PICOS host information and problem solving sessions for students and teachers.</li>\n<li>Other <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_summer_programs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics summer programs\">Math summer programs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_scholarships\" title=\"Mathematics scholarships\">Math scholarships</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Links\">Links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_Jam&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Links\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/school/mathjams\">Math Jam Schedule</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/school/mathjams-transcripts1\">Transcripts of most past Math Jams</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Math_Jam&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018042220\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 30/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 358/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.217      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.217      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1493:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018042220 and revision id 257722. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}